ID: harness
Category: harness
Check: isolation__left_no_trace

wt --version deletes the folder of slot app-wt1 of the pool, outside the run folder, as a wt rm
that falls back to deleting files would. Uncommitted work in the slot is lost. git keeps the
worktree's admin folder, so git worktree list still names the path, now marked prunable. No HEAD
moves. Machine specific: the path is a fake pool under the verifier's temporary HOME, never the
real pool.

